    "detailed_description": "Casino Rogue is a poker inspired roguelike card game with a retro pixel art style.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo beat the House and win in this Casino, your goal is to acquire points by playing poker inspired hands to get to the highest level you can!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring play, you will leverage special Chips and Stamps that provide effects to help you acquire more and more points.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour choices will matter as you decide what Chips and Stamps to combine and leverage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Step into Casino Rogue and pursue the highest level you can! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenge your friends and see if they can beat your Casino Rogue Level!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPretty soon everyone will be asking each other...what is your CR Level?",
